# CFA Knowledge Library — PDF + EPUB binaries are NOT tracked
# (large; ~1.5 GB total; content reproducible from legacy KB via the
# per-entry sha256 + library_path in _catalog.json).
#
# What IS tracked: this .gitignore, README.md, _catalog.json,
# per-subdir READMEs from the deferred-books inventory, and .gitkeep
# files in otherwise-empty subdirs (so the directory structure itself
# is committed even when no PDFs land in a given dir).

*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw*
*.djvu

# Allow the HTML deferred item (Damodaran Country Risk Premium) to be
# tracked if you decide to keep it as a structured reference; for now
# leave it gitignored consistent with PDFs.
*.html
